<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('../partials/head') %>

    <body>
        <%- include('../partials/header') %>
            <%- include('../partials/sidebar') %>
                <main>
                    <div class="product-container">
                        <div class="product-page">
                            <div class="product-image">
                                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/500x500" alt="Product Image">
                            </div>
                            <div class="product-details">
                                <div class="product-title">Wireless Noise Cancelling Headphones</div>
                                <div class="product-rating">⭐⭐⭐⭐☆ (4.5/5)</div>
                                <div class="product-price">$149.99</div>
                                <div class="product-description">
                                    Experience world-class sound and advanced noise cancellation with our latest
                                    wireless headphones. With up
                                    to 30 hours of battery life, fast charging, and comfortable over-ear fit, these are
                                    perfect for long
                                    listening sessions.
                                </div>

                                <div class="features">
                                    <h3>Key Features:</h3>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>Industry-leading noise cancellation</li>
                                        <li>30-hour battery life</li>
                                        <li>Touch controls</li>
                                        <li>Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity</li>
                                        <li>Built-in voice assistant</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>

                                <div class="product-buy">
                                    <button onclick="addToCart()">Add to Cart</button>
                                    <button onclick="buyNow()"
                                        style="background-color: #ffa41c; border: 1px solid #f89808;">Buy Now</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="shipping-info">
                            <h3>Shipping Information:</h3>
                            <p>Ships in 1-2 business days. Free shipping on orders over $50. Expedited options available
                                at checkout.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="specs">
                            <h3>Technical Specifications:</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Driver Size: 40mm</li>
                                <li>Frequency Response: 20Hz - 20kHz</li>
                                <li>Battery Life: 30 hours</li>
                                <li>Charging Time: 1.5 hours</li>
                                <li>Weight: 250g</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="reviews">
                            <h3>Customer Reviews:</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Jane D.:</strong> Amazing sound quality and great battery life!</li>
                                <li><strong>Mark T.:</strong> Love the comfort and noise cancellation.</li>
                                <li><strong>Linda P.:</strong> Worth every penny, highly recommend!</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="qa">
                            <h3>Q & A:</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Q:</strong> Does it support fast charging?<br><strong>A:</strong> Yes, it
                                    charges fully in about
                                    1.5 hours.</li>
                                <li><strong>Q:</strong> Can I use it with a wired connection?<br><strong>A:</strong>
                                    Yes, it includes an
                                    optional 3.5mm cable.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </main>
                <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
    </body>

</html>